# Share source and research progress; keep original archives/data local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/项目推进记录.md
!/研究总结与导师讨论/
!/ot_benchmark/
/研究总结与导师讨论/*
!/研究总结与导师讨论/*.md
!/研究总结与导师讨论/*.docx
/ot_benchmark/*
!/ot_benchmark/.gitignore
!/ot_benchmark/*.py
!/ot_benchmark/*.md
!/ot_benchmark/*.toml
!/ot_benchmark/requirements.txt
!/ot_benchmark/configs/
!/ot_benchmark/ot_benchmark/
!/ot_benchmark/tools/
!/ot_benchmark/tests/
!/ot_benchmark/research/
!/ot_benchmark/validation/
/ot_benchmark/validation/**/*
!/ot_benchmark/validation/**/
!/ot_benchmark/validation/**/*.md
!/ot_benchmark/validation/**/summary.json
!/ot_benchmark/validation/**/protocol.json
!/ot_benchmark/validation/**/*audit.json
!/ot_benchmark/validation/**/tests_round*.log
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest*/
**/.venv/
**/benchmark_results/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/credentials*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.npz
**/*.npy
**/*.pkl
**/*.joblib
**/*.zip
